OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ATrump's comments on a united Ireland
OL,4,Amay have targeted audience across the
OL,5,AAtlantic
OL,6,
OL,7,FAs the shockwaves of his remarks
OL,8,Frippled through this island and Great
OL,9,FBritain, it was unclear whether this
OL,10,Frepresented a new US administration
OL,11,Fpolicy, or an off-the-cuff remark from
OL,12,Fa president who likes to take questions
OL,13,Ffrom reporters, and likes to give
OL,14,Fanswers.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
